SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This repository contains multiple categories of files:

  a) RUNNER FILES (runner/, workers/) — governed by this Bitbybit Runner
     License.

  b) COMPANY-OWNED ASSETS (assets/, textures/) — governed by this Bitbybit
     Runner License.

  c) THIRD-PARTY FILES (babylonjs/, including its glslang/,
     twgsl/ and havok/, fonts/, wasm/manifold-*.wasm) — governed by their
     respective licenses (Apache 2.0, MIT, ISC, SIL OFL 1.1, zlib,
     BSD 3-Clause). See the NOTICE file for a complete list.

  d) MODIFIED FONTS (fonts/) — modified from originals obtained from
     Google Fonts. Governed by their original licenses (SIL Open Font
     License 1.1 or Apache 2.0). Modifications consist of automated
     geometry processing to remove self-intersecting outlines for
     compatibility with 3D text extrusion. See NOTICE for details.

  e) BITBYBIT OCCT KERNEL (wasm/bitbybit-dev-occt*.wasm) — MIT License
     (wasm/bitbybit-dev-occt.LICENSE.txt); closed source: the source code of
     its C++ kernel layer is not published. The OpenCASCADE Technology
     inside it is LGPL-2.1 with the Open CASCADE exception; see NOTICE. Its
     license, notice and license texts (wasm/bitbybit-dev-occt.LICENSE.txt,
     wasm/bitbybit-dev-occt.NOTICE.txt, wasm/licenses/) are reproduced as
     published.

  f) SCHEMAS (schemas/) — copied from the MIT-licensed @bitbybit-dev/occt
     package; MIT License.

This Bitbybit Runner License applies ONLY to categories (a) and (b) above.
It does not restrict your rights under the licenses that govern categories
(c), (d), (e) and (f).

